Id: mail003i
Severity: INFO
Category: services
Check: check_mail
Fix: Set a banner naming nothing (smtpd_banner=$myhostname ESMTP; smtp_banner).
References: postconf(5), exim(8), doveconf(1)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The mail server advertises its version in its banner. That is
the first thing an attacker asks; set a banner naming nothing.
